In the whole-document SQL shape there is no :PARAMETERS header, so every
@name placeholder is undeclared and warns (datasource_undeclared_placeholder,
feature.diagnostics_pipeline A21), ranged over the full @name span. The
SQL itself gets no SSL diagnostics and no formatting.
-- input.ds --
select shipment_id, carrier_code
from shipment
where carrier_code = @sCarrier
  and ship_date >= @dFrom
-- format --
select shipment_id, carrier_code
from shipment
where carrier_code = @sCarrier
  and ship_date >= @dFrom
-- diagnostics --
3:22-3:31 warning datasource_undeclared_placeholder: SQL data-source placeholder '@sCarrier' has no matching :PARAMETERS declaration — it is not substituted and fails when the query executes.
4:20-4:26 warning datasource_undeclared_placeholder: SQL data-source placeholder '@dFrom' has no matching :PARAMETERS declaration — it is not substituted and fails when the query executes.
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
3:22-3:31 warning datasource_undeclared_placeholder: SQL data-source placeholder '@sCarrier' has no matching :PARAMETERS declaration — it is not substituted and fails when the query executes.
4:20-4:26 warning datasource_undeclared_placeholder: SQL data-source placeholder '@dFrom' has no matching :PARAMETERS declaration — it is not substituted and fails when the query executes.
